{"inkVersion":20,"root":[[["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"stranger_1":["^I hope you newcomers aren't lazy and useless. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^The last thing this settlement needs is more freeloaders. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"stranger_2":["^I work dawn 'til dusk everyday. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Someone has to get stuff done around here. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"stranger_3":["^Can't talk right now I'm busy. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"stranger_4":["^Shouldn't you be useful and farming right now? ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_1":["^Do you need me to build something? ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^If not, then leave me alone. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_2":["^Why are you bothering me so much? ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^You're just like that annoying Jet guy. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^No, he's worse. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_3":["^Don't think I'll respect you cause you're the farmer from Earth. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^You gotta prove your worth to this settlement first. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_4":["^I can't stand freeloaders that do nothing all day. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^What a pathetic life that is. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^I'd be ashamed if I were them. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_1":["^Heya *player*. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Better not be slacking off out there on the farm. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^Don't make me check in on you. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_2":["^Business has been slow recently. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^People should work harder so they have the money for house remodels. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^Many of the homes here are hideous. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_3":["^What does the mayor even do these days? ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^He wouldn't last one day working a real job like mine. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^And the government was even bigger back on earth? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Hmmph, no thanks. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^No wonder why you left. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_4":["^Jet didn't show up to work the other day. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Who does he think he is? ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^He better not be thinking of switching jobs. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_1":["^All Jet ever talks about are girls and them stepping on him. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^What does that even mean? ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^Why would anyone want to be stepped on? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_2":["^Hey *player* you planning on being at the Tavern this week? ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^I might stop by... ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Seems like a waste of time though. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_3":["^The food here is so average. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^Is it true that on earth there were 5 star bakeries? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Maybe that planet isn't too bad after all. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_4":["^Hey *player* need anything built for the farm? ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^It probably looks dirty and old. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Don't worry, that's why I'm here. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_1":["^Hey *player* I have a new pastry recipe I want to try. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^Would you uhhh, mind taste testing when I'm done? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^It's only cause you'll give me your honest opinion. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^Jesse will just tell me it's good, even if it's a pile of turd. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_2":["^I had to make a new table for the Tavern the other day. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^Damien decided it was a good idea to \"atomic elbow\" a table the other night. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^That fat idiot... ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^At least look cool while doing it. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_3":["^Lucas approached me the other day asking for my insight on the idea of settlement expansion. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Finally, pretty boy asking the expert for his insight. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^Business might be booming soon. ",{"#":"emotion:xd"},"\n","^Marco would've been happy about that. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_4":["^Hey *player* make sure to keep yourself healthy. ",{"#":"speaker:Bryan"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^The last thing we need is our farmer to croak. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^I'd never forgive you if that happens. ",{"#":"emotion:annoyed"},"\n","^So, don't be an idiot and take care of yourself. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"two_hearts_scene":[["^Jet for the last time, I'm not going to the inn to waste time with your space friends. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^C'mon grumpelstiltskin, you need to take a load off. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^I can take a \"load off\" when I'm dead. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Wow that was deep. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^In order to be the greatest you must sacrifice pleasure for discipline. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm willing to do anything to refine my craft. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Ok Picasso you've lost me. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Your tiny little monkey brain wouldn't understand. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Ok first of all, I'm honored to have a monkey brain. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Second of all, if you don't take anytime for breaks you'll wilt by 30. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Right *player*? ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Leave *player* out of this! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Wait wilt?  ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^What do you mean by wilt? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It happened to my Step Uncle Carl. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Worked so hard he became as useful as a vegetable. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And smelled like vinegar. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^With no friends. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You remind me of a young Carl. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Wha-? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm nowhere close to Carl! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Not yet. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Stop it! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Just sayin. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^He's got to be speaking nonsense, right *player*?\" ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n",["ev",{"^->":"two_hearts_scene.0.90.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Stay on that grind!",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"two_hearts_scene.0.91.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^I'm not sure",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"two_hearts_scene.0.92.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":18},{"s":["^You should go to the inn",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"two_hearts_scene.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.90.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Jet is just peer pressuring you Bryan. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Stay on that grind! ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Yeah you're just trying to impede on my work! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I bet Carl isn't even real! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And I will not become a vegetable. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Nor smell like vinegar. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^How does someone even smell like that? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Sighhh because he was Carl. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That's how. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^That doesn't even make any sense. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I've wasted enough time with this stupid conversation. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm getting back to work. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"two_hearts_scene.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.91.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I'm not sure... ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^What kind of answer is that? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^A safe one. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^I will not be a vinegar smelling vegetable! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Not if you come to the inn with me! ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^I'm this close to making you wish you were never here Jet. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I wish I wasn't here! ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'd rather be at the inn! ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Ok fine, if I go to the inn with you for 15 minutes will you shut up? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I knew you'd crack! ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Onward! ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Hmph. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"two_hearts_scene.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.92.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Jet's right you should go to the inn. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^What? Why? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Don't want you ending up like Carl. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Aha! See? ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^You can't be serious right now... ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's 2 to 1. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^That means you're coming! ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^I expected more rationality from you *player*. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That's what I get for asking a farmer to back me up. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Ok grumpelstiltskin, less degrading and more walking. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Hmmph fine but only for 15 minutes. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And stop calling me that. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","done","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"four_hearts_scene":["^Make sure not to over bake the dough. ",{"#":"speaker: Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^And don't use too much butter! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Alright thanks. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Oh hey *player*! ",{"#":"speaker: Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^What brings you here today? ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Yeah w-what uhhh are you doing? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Are you here to get some baking ingredients? ",{"#":"speaker: Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Bryan just grabbed some as well. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Uhhh no I didn't! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Yes you did! ",{"#":"speaker: Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You literally just asked me for baking advice. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^I have no idea what you are talking about! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I have no interest or experience in this thing you call baking! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Isn't it so cute *player*? ",{"#":"Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Bryan is an aspiring baker! ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^No I'm not! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And don't ever call me cute. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm just a hard working blue collar carpenter getting a drink after a hard days work!","\n",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"^I don't have time to make measely pastries! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Then why did you ask for flour, butter, and sugar? ",{"#":"speaker: Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's a new diet I'm trying! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^To make me stronger so I can work more hours as a manly carpenter! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Well then I'd choose something healthier than that cake you're baking! ",{"#":"speaker: Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Wow look at the time, I got to go home and- ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Bake! ",{"#":"speaker: Jesse"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Goodbye! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"six_hearts_scene":["^It's just not good enough Jet, plain and simple! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Dude it looked unbelievable! ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Mr. Ben almost showed emotion! ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Do you know how hard it is for him to show any emotion? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I think he almost cracked a smile! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Over a hardwood floor! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^The color was too light for what Ben asked. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And it wasn't as smooth as it could be. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's just not good enough at this point. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I shouldn't show my face around the settlement as the carpenter. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^With a sorry job like that. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^What in the emo type of attitude is that? ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's not me being emo! ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You don't understand at all what I'm going through! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I have a job to fufill here on Raea! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^As THE carpenter for the settlement! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That means that everyone counts on me to take care of the places they live and work! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Bryan you're acting spunky today and it's getting me to feel a certain way. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Is everything a joke to you? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Depends on the angle of the sun. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^The legacy of my mentor is on my shoulders! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^He put his life into this place and his craft! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Being mediocre as his successor is not an option. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You and *player* don't understand! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You never will! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^First of all, not sure why you had to include *player* into this. ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Second of all, who cares about what your mentor thinks. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm sure your momma is proud. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^And that's all that matters! ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Get out of my shop. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Both of you. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Jet"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^C'mon *player*. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^We gotta bounce. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"eight_hearts_scene":["^Oh hey *player*, I wasn't expecting you. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Hey Bryan taking a break? ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Ahhh well you could say that I guess. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm sorry how I treated you the other day. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I was just upset at myself for the job I did that day. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That doesn't mean it was you or Jet's fault. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That's ok Bryan I forgive you. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You're a good friend *player*. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Forgiving somebody after they treat you like garbage. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You're just like Jet. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Except Jet always adds a stupid comment along with his acceptance. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Hmph... classic Jet. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I didn't mean to snap like that. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I honestly hate acting that way. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Burned many bridges because of it. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's just... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Whenever I underperform, I just get so angry and disappointed. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I can't help but to feel like I'm disappointing my mentor. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^He was an legenadry carpenter that dedicated his life to his work. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^After he got old, he gave the reigns to me being his successor to his shop. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Those are enormous shoes to fill. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And I'm failing to fill them each and everyday. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I've worked so hard on my craft. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^To try and be a respectable successor. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Because of this, I've definitely shut people out of my life. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And yet, after all these sacrifices, ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's still not good enough. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And I wonder if it'll ever be good enough. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Thank you for your forgiveness today *player*. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm going to go back to work. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Please take care of yourself. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"ten_hearts_scene":["^Oh hey *player* what's up. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Back on break I see. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Haha yeah... ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Trying to take more breaks these days. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Jesse says it's better for my health. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I believe her. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^But it's driving me crazy. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I didn't know you and Jesse talked. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Oh er- well we've been friends since childhood. ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Grew up together as cryo children. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Cryo children? ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^How do you not know about the cryo children? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You were supposed to be part of the Originals right? ",{"#":"speaker: Bryan"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Well cryo children were the embryos preserved for the trip. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Meaning we were frozen on the ship of the Originals. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That means our parents were left on earth. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Meaning they're already dead at this point. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Cryo children are futuristic orphans to put it simply. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Jesse and I grew up at the Labaratory. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^We were fed and educated on a basic level. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Then assigned to be mentored for specific jobs that the settlement needed at that time. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I was assigned to be a carpenter obviously. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That's where I met my mentor.. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^He was a dedicated man, the hardest worker I've ever met. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^He was a harsh mentor. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^But it was important lessons to make me the man I am today. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^He was the father figure that I never had. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That's why it's so important to me to live up to his legacy. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^To keep this carpentry running in a way that would replicate his legacy. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I just want him to be proud of me. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That's why I work so hard each and everyday. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Y'know... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Despite how obsessed I am with my craft, ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I have to acknowledge that you are important to me *player*. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^As well as Jesse and Jet. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^You guys genuinely care about me. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^So I baked you a strawberry short cake for you. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Yes I- ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Like baking... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That doesn't make me less than a man you know! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Just don't tell Jet... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^He would never let me hear the end of it. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Don't eat it in front of me either! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I get... Uncomfortable... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Anyways I better get back to work. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Let me know how the cake tastes. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"get_random_knot_by_relation":["ev",{"VAR?":"relation"},"/ev",["du","ev","str","^stranger","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_stranger_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^acquaintance","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_acquaintance_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^friend","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_friend_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^goodfriend","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_goodfriend_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^bestfriend","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_bestfriend_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"pop","nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"get_random_stranger_knot":["ev",1,4,"rnd","/ev",["du","ev",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_1"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_2"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",3,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_3"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",4,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_4"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"pop","nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"get_random_acquaintance_knot":["ev",1,4,"rnd","/ev",["